# Raw OpenFOAM solver output from the evaluation runs. Regenerable from the tracked
# case setup (0/, constant/, system/, Allrun) by re-running the case, and the evidence
# the report actually cites — metrics, centreline profiles, residual and streamline
# plots — is extracted into evaluation/artifacts/, which IS tracked.
#
# What this excludes: ~19 MB, dominated by three 3.5 MB icoFoam logs and the written
# time directories. Keeping them would put more bytes of regenerable text in the pack
# than the entire rest of the repository.
runs/*/log.icoFoam
runs/*/constant/polyMesh/
# Written time directories (5, 10, ... 50). `0/` is the initial condition — an input —
# and stays tracked.
runs/*/[1-9]*/
